	(text "L1/C16 and similar form 2nd order butterworth filter\nat 60kHz to reduce EMI per reference designs. L1 can\nbe omitted and C16 forms a 1st order butterworth filter.\nUse only C16 and similar of 470nF for 85kHz cutoff.\nFerrite beads and 33pF capacitors are to reduce higher\nfrequency RF EMI per datasheet and reference designs.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 194.31 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
